  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"main-page-tag-lcs main-page-tag-lcs-exploded\"><div class=\"lcs-container\">\n<center>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Welcome\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"700\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Welcome.png\" data-image-key=\"Welcome.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/42/Welcome.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/700?cb=20171017234023\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>An encyclopedia for Sean McKnight's Second Renaissance series that <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Editing\" title=\"Help:Editing\">anyone can edit</a>.</b>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Statistics\" title=\"Special:Statistics\">357 articles</a> since August 2015.<br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"About\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"About.png\" data-image-key=\"About.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/7c/About.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20171017233435\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</center>\n<p><b>The Second Renaissance</b> is a futurist series written by American engineer and writer Sean McKnight (YNot1989). He began creating this series in 2007 and reworked it over the course of years to its current form. The Second Renaissance chronicles the next century of politics and war, science and technology, culture and history through the lens of realist forecasting via high concept sci-fi. Originally envisioned as a Utopian sci-fi universe, the series has evolved into a brutally realist look into the next century and beyond. The Second Renaissance started life on&#160;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://future.fandom.com/wiki/Scenario:_The_Second_Renaissance\">Future.wikia</a>, and the bulk of its material is still there for all to enjoy, however, it has been given its own site because Future.wikia could not contain it any longer.\n</p><p><i>\"Once in a great while, civilizations undergo a period of massive society change effecting everything from economics to culture. In the 14th Century, Western Civilization underwent the first change of this kind, and since then many smaller ones have occurred across the globe. The Age of Enlightenment, the Industrial Revolution, the Information age. However none of these smaller revolutions compare to the magnitude of change that occurred during the Renaissance over three centuries. In the 22nd Century the world entered into the Second Renaissance. This is the story of how that came to be.\"</i>\n</p><p><i>This is a future history prone to being overwritten by real-world events though updating can lag behind.</i>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"New Articles\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"244\" height=\"39\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"New Articles.png\" data-image-key=\"New_Articles.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/2c/New_Articles.png/revision/latest?cb=20171017233036\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"fandom-slider orientation-bottom\">\n\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__controls\">\n<p>\t\t<a class=\"fandom-slider__controls__prev\" aria-label=\"Previous photo\">\n\t\t\t<svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-arrow-tiny\"></use></svg>\t\t</a>\n</p><p>\t\t<a class=\"fandom-slider__controls__next\" aria-label=\"Previous photo\">\n\t\t\t<svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-arrow-tiny\"></use></svg>\t\t</a>\n</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerybox\" data-index=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6f/SR_Timeline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/670?cb=20151207011824\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"670\" height=\"353\" data-image-name=\"SR Timeline.png\" data-image-key=\"SR_Timeline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerybox\" data-index=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c7/Liza_Maheswaran.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/296?cb=20181104193549\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"296\" height=\"360\" data-image-name=\"Liza Maheswaran.png\" data-image-key=\"Liza_Maheswaran.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerybox\" data-index=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\" data-image-name=\"Cold War Logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Cold_War_Logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Cold_War_Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20171018054154\" class=\"lazyload\" /></span>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerybox\" data-index=\"3\">\n\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"670\" height=\"345\" data-image-name=\"Alo YBP1194 c.png\" data-image-key=\"Alo_YBP1194_c.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/75/Alo_YBP1194_c.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/670?cb=20230623202301\" class=\"lazyload\" /></span>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav\">\n\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__caption-0\" data-index=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Chronology of Events</p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/Timeline\" class=\"read-more-link\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span> Read more &gt;</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__caption-1\" data-index=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Character spotlight: Liza Maheswaran</p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Maheswaran\" class=\"read-more-link\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span> Read more &gt;</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__caption-2\" data-index=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>The conflict in the Sahara</p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/Sahara_War\" class=\"read-more-link\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span> Read more &gt;</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__caption-3\" data-index=\"3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Advanced civilizations</p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/Alo\" class=\"read-more-link\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span> Read more &gt;</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__thumbs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__thumb-0\" data-index=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6f/SR_Timeline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/95?cb=20151207011824\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"95\" height=\"50\" data-image-name=\"SR Timeline.png\" data-image-key=\"SR_Timeline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__thumb-1\" data-index=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"78\" data-image-name=\"Liza Maheswaran.png\" data-image-key=\"Liza_Maheswaran.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c7/Liza_Maheswaran.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20181104193549\" class=\"lazyload\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__thumb-2\" data-index=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-image-name=\"Cold War Logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Cold_War_Logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Cold_War_Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20171018054154\" class=\"lazyload\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fandom-slider__nav__thumb-3\" data-index=\"3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"98\" height=\"50\" data-image-name=\"Alo YBP1194 c.png\" data-image-key=\"Alo_YBP1194_c.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/75/Alo_YBP1194_c.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/98?cb=20230623202301\" class=\"lazyload\" /></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"MainpageHeaderSecondRenaissance\" style=\"padding:0.2em 0.4em; margin:10px 0 10px 0; border:1px solid #000; background:#2E5884; color:#FFF; font-size:120%; font-weight:bold; text-align:left; -moz-border-radius:0.2em;\"><span id=\"Contents_.28view_all_pages.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contents_(view_all_pages)\">Contents <small>(<a href=\"/wiki/Special:AllPages\" title=\"Special:AllPages\">view all pages</a>)</small></span></h2>\n<table class=\"\" style=\"background-color:transparent; color:inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;\">\n<p><b>Society and Technology</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Armor\" title=\"Armor\">Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Virtuals\" title=\"Virtuals\">Virtuals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gravitonics\" title=\"Gravitonics\">Gravitonics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Genetic_Engineering\" title=\"Genetic Engineering\">Genetic Engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Capacitor\" title=\"Quantum Capacitor\">Quantum Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Human_Civil_Rights_Movement\" title=\"Non-Human Civil Rights Movement\">Non-Human Civil Rights Movement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Augment_Rights_Movement\" title=\"Augment Rights Movement\">Augment Rights Movement</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>Aliens and Non-humans</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/K%27lerin\" title=\"K&#39;lerin\">K'lerin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Moraks\" title=\"Moraks\">Moraks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tel-bn\" title=\"Tel-bn\">Tel-bn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Androids\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Androids\">Androids</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;\">\n<p><b>War and Politics</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Timeline\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Timeline\">Timeline</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/21st_Century\" title=\"21st Century\">21st Century</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/22nd_Century\" title=\"22nd Century\">22nd Century</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Reset\" title=\"Great Reset\">Great Reset</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Economic_Model\" title=\"Quantum Economic Model\">Quantum Economic Model</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican War</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/World_War_III\" title=\"World War III\">World War III</a></li></ul>\n<p><b><a href=\"/wiki/Sol_system\" title=\"Sol system\">Planets</a></b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Earth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mars\" title=\"Mars\">Mars</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Luna\" title=\"Luna\">Luna</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Venus\" title=\"Venus\">Venus</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poll\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"261\" height=\"43\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Poll.png\" data-image-key=\"Poll.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/69/Poll.png/revision/latest?cb=20171017233228\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<center><small>Vote now!</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Poll_archive\" title=\"Poll archive\">See more &gt;</a></center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"main-page-tag-rcs\">\t<div class=\"fandom-ad-placeholder fandom-ad-wrapper\">\n<p>\t<fandom-ad id=\"top_boxad\"></fandom-ad>\n</p>\n\t<div id=\"label-top_boxad\" class=\"fandom-ad-label\" data-key=\"advertisement\">\n<p>\t\tAdvertisement\n</p>\n\t</div>\n</div><div class=\"rcs-container\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"User Blogs-01\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"User Blogs-01.png\" data-image-key=\"User_Blogs-01.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/1c/User_Blogs-01.png/revision/latest?cb=20171017233832\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Helping-01\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Helping-01.png\" data-image-key=\"Helping-01.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/3f/Helping-01.png/revision/latest?cb=20171017232820\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<center>We are currently housing <a href=\"/wiki/Special:Statistics\" title=\"Special:Statistics\">357</a> articles, and <a href=\"/wiki/Special:Statistics\" title=\"Special:Statistics\">900</a> files. We need YOUR help expanding and adding articles to the wiki!</center> \n<div style=\"font-variant: small-caps\"><center><a href=\"/wiki/Special:NewPages\" title=\"Special:NewPages\">New pages</a> | <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Tutorial\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikia:Help:Tutorial\">Wiki tutorial</a> | <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Help\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikia:Category:Help\">Help pages</a></center></div>\n<center>If you're new to wikia, please use the above links to get started.</center>\n<center>If you already have editing experience, and you noticed an article from Future.wikia is missing to the series, please to contribute, use the box below to create it:</center>\n<p>&lt;createbox&gt;width=30&lt;/createbox&gt;<br />\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Adding content</dt></dl>\n<ul><li>Every wiki has two list of articles that need help called  <b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Article stubs (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6QXJ0aWNsZV9zdHVicz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">\"Stubs\"</span></b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Special:WantedPages\" title=\"Special:WantedPages\">\"Wanted Articles\"</a></b>. Don't be shy, just get in there.</li>\n<li>Uploading <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Images\" title=\"Category:Images\">images</a> is another really easy way to help out - see the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload\" title=\"Special:Upload\">Special:Upload</a></b> page!</li>\n<li>You can find a list of useful templates on <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Templates\" title=\"Category:Templates\">Category:Templates</a>, some of which are documented on the <b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Second Renaissance Wikia:Templates (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2Vjb25kX1JlbmFpc3NhbmNlX1dpa2lhOlRlbXBsYXRlcz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">templates project page</span></b>.</li></ul>\n<dl><dt>Talk and more...</dt></dl>\n<ul><li>Check out the <b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Second Renaissance Wikia:Community Portal (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2Vjb25kX1JlbmFpc3NhbmNlX1dpa2lhOkNvbW11bml0eV9Qb3J0YWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">community portal</span></b> to see what the community is working on, to give feedback or just to say hi.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Special:RecentChanges\" title=\"Special:RecentChanges\">Special:RecentChanges</a> to see what's new.(No longer available to anyone without a registered Fandom account)</li></ul>\n</div></div><p><br style=\"clear:both;\" />\n</p><p><br /> \n</p>\n<hr />\n<table style=\"padding:0.5em; margin-top:1em; width:100%; border:1px solid #aaa;\" cellspacing=\"2\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"plainlinks\"></div>\n<p><big><i>Affiliated wikis:</i></big><br />\n</p><p><b><a href=\"https://althistory.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:althistory\">Alternate History Wiki</a></b> &#8226;\n<b><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/c:oprandomstuff\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:oprandomstuff\">OPRandomStuff Wiki</a></b> &#8226;\n<b><a href=\"https://future.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:future\">Future Wiki</a></b>&#8226;\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr />\n<p><br style=\"clear:both;\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205334\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.099 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 56/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 791/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 61/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5775/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.728      1 -total\n 11.08%    1.964      1 Template:MainpageHeading_SecondRenaissance\n  9.88%    1.751      1 Template:AffiliatedWikis\n  9.41%    1.668      1 Template:Col-begin\n  9.17%    1.625      2 Template:Col-2\n  8.37%    1.483      1 Template:Col-end\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:2-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205334 and revision id 11916. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
